>**{c=red:If you have any other }{n:Borghertz's|Borghertz}{c=red: Hands quest active, you must complete that one before you can start this quest!}**
=2 Walkthrough
* Travel to "Durable Shields" in {z:Upper Jeuno} and speak with {n:Guslam} located at (H-8) to begin the quest.
* Go to {z:Ifrit's Cauldron}

:* Unity Warp (Level 122) > Yhoator Jungle > hug the right wall. It's a short ride.
:* Alternatively, you may use the Elshimo Uplands Outpost Warp or Survival Guide.

* Either obtain a {i:Cauldron Coffer Key|Cld. Coffer Key|1053} and use it to open one of the chests found in the area, or pick the lock as a {p:Thief}.

:* You do not need to be on {p:Ninja} when opening the coffer.
:* You may purchase a {i:Cauldron Coffer Key|Cld. Coffer Key|1053} from any Nation's {p:Curio Vendor Moogle}.

* You will receive a {@k}{k:Old gauntlets} from the coffer.
* Return to {z:Upper Jeuno} and speak to {n:Guslam}. He will inform you he is unable to repair the gauntlets.
* Speak to {n:Deadly Minnow} inside of the Durable Shields shop.
* Head to {z:Lower Jeuno} inside the Tenshodo area. Speak with {n:Yin Pocanakhu} at (J-8) and then trade 1,000 gil to continue.

:* If you have completed the AF hands quest on another job, you do not need to view this cutscene or pay gil.

* Go to {z:Port Jeuno} and head to the crates near the AH and Jeuno Duty-Free Shop at (H-8).
* Click on the ??? to receive a cutscene.
* Travel to {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys} and go to (F-8) on the first map.

:* Easiest way here is {p:Survival Guide} Teleport.
:* Otherwise, you'll have to walk it from the {z:Castle Zvahl Keep} {p:Home Point}.

* Click on one of the torches to spawn {m:Dark Spark}.
* Once {m:Dark Spark} is defeated, examine the same torch you used to spawn it. You will receive the {@k}{k:Shadow flames}.

:* Note: If you forget to click the Torch after killing the {m:Dark Spark}, you can come back and click the same one and still receive your {@k}{k:Shadow flames}.

* Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene, the quest is complete.

=2 Two Additional Coffers
{n:Guslam} mentions that there is still armor scattered about Vana'diel. You can find two more pieces of armor by opening coffers in the following zones with the corresponding coffer key:
* {z:Sea Serpent Grotto} - {@i:Ninja Kyahan|14101} {i:Ninja Kyahan|Ninja Kyahan|14101}
** This area requires you to pass the Mythril Door and obtain a {p:Grotto Coffer Key}, which can be obtained from various enemies in the area past the Mythril door.
** Interact with the door multiple times until it mentions __"You find something that looks like mythril dust scattered about the indentation."__, and then you will be able to trade a {i:Mythril Beastcoin|Mtl. Beastcoin|749} to it to get access to Map 3.
** All of the Treasure Coffers are in this part of the zone.
* {z:The Boyahda Tree} - {@i:Ninja Hatsuburi|13869} {i:Ninja Hatsuburi|Ninja Hatsuburi|13869}
** This item requires you to obtain a {i:Byd. Coffer Key|Byd. Coffer Key|1052} from the various enemies that inhabit the zone.
** These coffers are not required to complete the quest, therefore after you receive your hands the quest is "completed".
** The quest must either be active or completed in order to receive these attire pieces.
** You **must** have {p:Ninja} as your main job when you open these coffers.

